\par\par \b \uc2 China's yuan slumps to over 5-yr low on Brexit fears, c.bank suspected of  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 480 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juni 2016\par 06:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2016 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par SHANGHAI, June 24 (Reuters) - The yuan slumped to more than\par 5-year lows around midday on Friday, prompting the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  via state banks' selling dollars as turmoil jolted\par global markets in the wake of voting results suggesting Britain\par will opt to leave the \f28 \uc2 \f2 EU\f28 \uc2 \f2 .\par    Traders said state-owned banks were seen offering dollar\par liquidity in the market - the modus operandi the \f28 \uc2 \f2 People's Bank\par of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  employs when \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market.\par     Britain has voted to leave the \f28 \uc2 \f2 European Union\f28 \uc2 \f2 , the BBC said\par based on voter tallies from Thursday's referendum, an outcome\par that would set the country on an uncertain path and deal the\par largest setback to European efforts to forge greater unity since\par World War Two. \par     "Brexit will be a total disaster in China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market," said\par a trader at a Chinese commercial bank in Shanghai, a comment\par that underscored wild gyrations in global markets that saw the\par sterling plunge and stocks put to the sword on Brexit anxiety.\par     \f28 \uc2 \f2 The People's Bank of China\f28 \uc2 \f2  set the midpoint rate \par at 6.5776 per dollar prior to market open, 0.18 percent weaker\par than the previous fix at 6.5658. \par     The yuan hit an intraday low of 6.6148 at 0245 GMT,\par weakening more than 0.5 percent compared with 6.5795 at the\par close on Thursday.\par     It trimmed some losses, trading at 6.6061 around midday due\par to suspected \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , traders said.\par     "Our mother has come!" exclaimed a trader at another Chinese\par commercial bank in Shanghai, referring to the nickname for the\par \f28 \uc2 \f2 PBOC\f28 \uc2 \f2 . \par     State-owned banks have engaged in dollar selling activities\par on behalf of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  so far this year to shore up the\par yuan when the Chinese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has faced massive depreciation\par pressure.\par     The offshore yuan was trading 0.36 percent softer than the\par onshore spot at 6.6299 per dollar. \par \par     The yuan market at a glance: \par     \par     ONSHORE:\par  Item               Current  Previous  Change\par  PBOC midpoint      6.5776   6.5658    -0.18%\par                                        \par  Spot yuan          6.6061   6.5795    -0.40%\par                                        \par  Divergence from    0.43%              \par  midpoint*                             \par  Spot change YTD                       -1.70%\par  Spot change since 2005                25.29%\par  revaluation                           \par  \par *Divergence of the dollar/yuan exchange rate. Negative number\par indicates that spot yuan is trading stronger than the midpoint.\par \f28 \uc2 \f2 The People's Bank of China (PBOC) \f28 \uc2 \f2 allows the exchange rate to\par rise or fall 2 percent from official midpoint rate it sets each\par morning.\par \par     OFFSHORE CNH MARKET   \par   \par  Instrument            Current   Difference\par                                  from onshore\par  Offshore spot yuan    6.6299    -0.36%\par         *                        \par  Offshore              6.778     -2.96%\par  non-deliverable                 \par  forwards                        \par                **                \par  \par *Premium for offshore spot over onshore \par **Figure reflects difference from \f28 \uc2 \f2 PBOC\f28 \uc2 \f2 's official midpoint,\par since non-deliverable forwards are settled against the midpoint.\par . \par     \par     \par \par     \par  (Reporting by the Shanghai Newsroom; Editing by Shri\par Navaratnam)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-6-24T05:39:10.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160624ec6o00m5a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
