\par\par \b \uc2 RPT-CHINA MONEY-Change of menu? Investors lose appetite for yuan assets\b0\par\par\uc2 699 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2016\par 03:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2016 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Repeats story published on March 25 with no changes to text)\par \par \uc2 By Lu Jianxin and Pete Sweeney\par \par \uc2 SHANGHAI, March 25 (Reuters) - China's changing of the way it reports its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  data has brought it into line with international practice but the timing appears to have worsened the market's appetite for yuan assets.\par \par \uc2 The data - \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchase position - measures how much foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is sold or bought by both the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and commercial financial institutions. It was replaced with data that captures only the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases.\par \par \uc2 The omission since February fanned growing suspicion that Beijing might be masking the extent of capital outflows amid a slowing economy and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakness.\par \par \uc2 Making matters worse, the \uc2 People's Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's (\uc2 PBOC\uc2 ) increased \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the forwards and swaps markets which sowed more confusion about its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy.\par \par \uc2 "The timing was really bad. The change was made during a time that the yuan faced increasing depreciation pressure and the economy was not faring well," said Zhang Yiping, analyst at China Merchants Securities in Shenzhen.\par \par \uc2 Investors were also concerned about China's falling reserves and that it would have a hard time shoring up the yuan.\par \par \uc2 Demand for yuan-denominated assets have fallen since the start of the year, with volumes in the dim sum bond markets plummeting. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://tmsnrt.rs/1LG49UZ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://tmsnrt.rs/1LG49UZ}}}\par \par \uc2 Investors have dumped Chinese stocks since last June, while the yuan has been under depreciation pressure in the second half of 2015.\par \par \uc2 Xu Gao, chief macroeconomic analyst at Everbright Securities, said a lag between the publication of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases and foreign reserves data meant analysts had looked to \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases as a leading indicator of outbound flows. A rise in \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases points to inflows, and a fall, to outflows.\par \par \uc2 That role took on greater significance last year as the exchange rate softened and Chinese businesses rushed to repay their dollar-denominated liabilities.\par \par \uc2 HIDING A SLIDE?\par \par \uc2 In December - the last month in which the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchase data was reported - Chinese banks sold a net 568.3 billion yuan ($86.4 billion) worth of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , nearly double November's net sales - followed by a sharp drop of $99.5 billion in the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves in January , the second-largest monthly drop on record.\par \par \uc2 The decision to halt publishing the combined \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchase and sales position data came shortly afterwards, and it was implemented without notice: it disappeared from reports and was replaced by a line showing \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  net purchases.\par \par \uc2 Some analysts suspected the omission helped Beijing conceal the role Chinese commercial banks were playing in buying yuan to support the \uc2 PBOC\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Honestly, given that these days commercial banks possess an ever-increasing amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the omission could obscure the 'firewall' role played by state banks in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," said an economist at a Chinese securities brokerage who declined to be named due to the sensitive subject.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 PBOC\uc2  and others justified the change by saying the data was statistically problematic. It overlaps with other data and, in some cases, allows for double counting of commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  assets.\par \par \uc2 The reshuffle of the composition of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  data, however, brings the \uc2 PBOC\uc2  into line with international practice.\par \par \uc2 "The \uc2 PBOC\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  assets data is more representative," said Huang Yi, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading at Guangfa Bank in Shanghai.\par \par \uc2 But despite the \uc2 PBOC\uc2 's stated intentions to let market forces play a greater role in pricing, onshore and offshore exchange rates have been tightly controlled in recent weeks. The traded rates have closely followed the official guidance rate since mid-February. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://tmsnrt.rs/1LG3u5T"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://tmsnrt.rs/1LG3u5T}}}\par \par \uc2 "In the past few months, the \uc2 PBOC\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  intensively to prevent a fast depreciation of CNY, and many believe that they have also stepped into the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  forward market," noted Zhou Hao, senior emerging markets economist at Commerzbank in Singapore.\par \par \uc2 Analysts say that may explain how Beijing managed to stabilise the exchange rate while at the same time slowing the drain on its \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves.\par \par \uc2 (Additional Reporting by Shanghai Newsroom; Editing by Jacqueline Wong)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-3-31T01:00:01.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160328ec3s001p5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
