iewed by the Executive Directors for the purpose of allocating \par      resources and assessing performance. \par  \par      As almost the entire Group's consolidated revenue and results are attributable to the market in the PRC and almost \par      all of the Group's consolidated assets are located in the PRC, the Executive Directors consider the business mainly \par      from product perspective. The Group is principally engaged in the property development, property investment and \par      hotel \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . Other services provided by the Group mainly represent property management and property agency. \par      The results of these \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  are included in the "all other segments" column. \par  \par      The Executive Directors assess the performance of the operating segments based on a measure of profit for the \par      year. \par  \par  \par  \par  \par                                                         - 12 - \par  \par  \par  \par  \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 10 Mar 2016 23:17 ET \par HK Bourse: Results Announcement From \f28 \uc2 \f2 Guangzhou R&F Properties Co. Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . -7-\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par The segment information provided to the Executive Directors for the reportable segments for the year ended 31 \par December 2015 and the segment assets and liabilities at 31 December 2015 are as follows: \par  \par                                             Property       Property        Hotel      All other \par                                          development     investment    \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2      segments          Group \par  \par                                            40,744,245      925,827      1,226,483     1,852,650     44,749,205 \par Segment revenue \par                                                    --       (68,572)       (45,333)     (344,37