ing and Brisbane in Australia -- contributed contracted sales for \par the first time, which together accounted for 3% of the overall total. At the city level, contracted sales \par for Guangzhou and Beijing remained the highest of all cities at RMB11.185 billion and RMB10.353 \par billion respectively, accounting for 21% and 19% of our total sales in 2015. The combined contracted \par sales for these two cities accounted for approximately 40% of the Group's total contracted sales. In \par 2015, the Group launched, in total, 14 new projects in 11 cities in China and Australia, accounting \par for 15% of total contracted sales of the Group. Total contracted sales of the Group in terms of GFA \par increased by 2% to 4,110,400 sq.m. from 4,048,200 sq.m., and the average selling price in 2015 was \par RMB13,200 per sq.m., substantially in line with RMB13,400 per sq.m. in 2014. \par  \par  \par  \par  \par                                                  - 21 - \par  \par Details of the Group's 2015 contracted sales by geographical distribution are set out below: \par                                     Approximate \par                                     saleable area                  Approximate \par Location                                     sold +/- % vs. 2014     total value +/- % vs. 2014 \par                                          (sq.m.)                 (RMB million) \par  \par Guangzhou                                457,800            -14%            11,185             -22% \par Huizhou                                  222,100             45%             1,627              47% \par Chongqing                                246,000             -4%             1,302              -9% \par Chengdu                                  138,900              0%               751               0% \par Fuzhou                                    68,500            164%             1,326             161% \par Meizhou                                  298,900             45%   