                                      4          220,000          193,000 \par Foshan                                                           1          209,000          157,000 \par Nanning                                                          1          150,000          105,000 \par Shenyang                                                         2          139,000           93,000 \par Zhuhai                                                           1          135,000           99,000 \par Nanjing and Vicinity                                             2          118,000           86,000 \par Chengdu                                                          1          117,000           87,000 \par Guiyang                                                          1           63,000           46,000 \par Xian                                                             2           56,000           35,000 \par Datong                                                           1           22,000                0 \par  \par Total                                                           64       12,319,000        8,849,000 \par  \par  \par  \par  \par                                                - 23 - \par  \par Current Major Property Development \par  \par Southern China \par  \par The Group did not enter any new cities in the region during the year; its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in Southern \par China covered ten cities, which contributed contracted sales in the year. This was the first year for \par Nanning and Zhuhai to contribute contracted sales to the Group. \par  \par Guangzhou is the Group's key city in Southern China. The city recorded the highest contracted sales \par of the Group, not simply for Southern China but for all the cities where it operates. Contracted sales \par for Guangzhou in the year amounted to RMB11.19 billion. Sales were mainly derived from nine \par continuing projects. Sales performance of R&F Dongshan Xintiandi (a continuing project launched \par in 2013) was satisfactory, accounting for approximately 49% of contracted sales in Guangzhou and \par recording the highest sales of all development projects in Guangzhou. In 2016, the Group will put \par efforts on R&F Yuexi Garden (Bigangcun Project) which will be one of the projects in Guangdong \par province to be launched. \par  \par Huizhou is one of the cities where the Group has been operating for years. Huizhou R&F Bay Shore \par is located at the heart of the top three seaside tourist attractions in Guangdong province, namely \par Xunliao Bay, Shuangyue Bay and Yapo Corner, with total GFA of approximately 5.30 million sq.m. \par Huizhou R&F Bay Shore offers well-equipped facilities. With an emerging lifestyle for health, wellness \par and leisure, R&F Bay Shore project has an ecological park with an area of 29,000 sq.m., having a \par health valley, a water park and a seaside greenway. Sales performance of the project was satisfactory \par upon its launch with 1,100 units sold, the third highest transactions of all projects in seaside area of \par Huizhou in 2015. \par  \par After the Group entered the Meizhou property market with the rigid demand project Meizhou R&F \par City last year, the sales of the project totaled approximately RMB1.53 billion in 2015. The saleable \par area of the project is anticipated to be more than 300,000 sq.m. in 2016, a considerable revenue is \par expected by the Group. Meizhou R&F City is located at the core zone of Meixian New Town in \par Meizhou City with planned site area of 662,942 sq.m. and a total GFA of 2,351,581 sq.m. The project \par is planned for the construction of mid-to-high end residential properties. \par  \par In addition to the above cities, the Group's R&F Center, in Fuzhou was well-received by the public \par in 2015. With the strictly implementation of the Group's marketing channel strategy with three key \par principles of "maximizing sales, securing geographical presence and controlling costs", the Group \par will achieve excellent sales performance in Fuzhou through smooth business \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operation\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . \par  \par Northern China \par  \par The Group developed new markets and operated in 13 cities in Northern China in the year. Beijing, \par Tianjin and Taiyuan were the key sales contributors in Northern China. The three cities provided 13 \par projects for sales with up to approximately RMB21.18 billion of total contracted sales. \par  \par In 2015, the contracted sales of the Group in Beijing was approximately RMB10.35 billion, achieving \par outstanding performance. The contracted sales was principally from four projects, namely Tongzhou \par R&F Center, Beijing R&F New Town, R&F Huilan Meju and R&F Shangyue Court. Tongzhou \par R&F Center Project (also known as R&F Tongzhou Yunhe No. 10) is located in Tongzhou New \par Town of Tongzhou District, Beijing with a planned site area of 69,796 sq.m. and a total GFA of \par 465,800 sq.m. It will provide residential units, apartments, commercial properties and offices in one \par development. The residential units will mainly be flats with high-quality decor complemented by \par high-end properties. Beijing R&F New Town is located in Xianghe New Town District adjacent to \par  \par                                                  - 24 - \par  \par  \par  \par  \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 10 Mar 2016 23:18 ET \par HK Bourse: Results Announcement From \f28 \uc2 \f2 Guangzhou R&F Properties Co. Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . -13-\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par the Xianghe Exit of Jingha Expressway in Xianghe County. Xianghe is located along the core corridor \par zone of the Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei region and connects with the business circle in eastern Beijing. The \par project has a total GFA of 1,937,660 sq.m. and is planned for the construction of high-end residential \par properties. In 2016, major projects of the Group to be put onto the market in Beijing will remain \par Tongzhou R&F Center Project and Beijing R&F New Town. \par  \par In 2015, the contracted sales of the Group in Tianjin totaled approximately RMB5.96 billion, over \par 50% of which was from R&F Jinmen Lake Project. The Group focused on the development and the \par launch of Tianjin R&F New Town Project in Tianjin in 2016. Tianjin R&F New Town is located at \par the junction of Renai Avenue and Zeshui North Road in Tuanpo New Town Eastern District in \par Tianjin with a planned site area of 1,440,497 sq.m. and a total GFA of 2,160,999 sq.m. The project \par is planned to be built into an integrated complex featuring mainly low density residences and high- \par rise residential buildings, complemented by boutique commercial properties. \par  \par In 2015, the contracted sales of the Group in Taiyuan totaled approximately RMB4.87 billion, mostly \par from Taiyuan R&F City. In addition, Pullman Taiyuan R&F Hotel officially opened in April 2015 \par and it is located in Taiyuan R&F City where easily accessible to Taiyuan airport, train station, major \par commercial and shopping centers in 20 minutes. The hotel has 279 guest rooms with well-equipped \par facilities, including modern food and beverage outlets, event venue and other ancillary facilities. In \par addition to the launch of Taiyuan R&F City, Taiyuan R&F Prosperous Palace and Taiyuan R&F \par Xiyue Court for sale in 2016, the Group is expected to launch the sales of several new projects to \par further increase the sales in Taiyuan. \par  \par In addition, the projects in Northern China are planned to be developed and/or launched by the \par Group in 2016 include: Shanghai R&F Hongqiao No. 10 is located within the core area of Hongqiao \par Business Zone in Minhang District with a planned site area of 152,455 sq.m. and a total GFA of \par 534,058 sq.m. The project will provide a variety of properties, such as high-end residential units, \par office towers of international standards, customised offices, flagship commercial properties and high- \par end hotels; Harbin R&F City is located at Youyi West Road in Daoli District, Harbin adjacent to \par the core zone of the Songbei Financial CBD. The project has a planned site area of 399,197 sq.m. \par and a total GFA of 832,500 sq.m. The project is planned to be built into an integrated complex \par featuring mainly low-density residences and high-rise residential buildings with high-quality decoration, \par complemented and enhanced by boutique commercial properties; Nanjing R&F Shangyue Court is \par located at Xinhu Avenue in Banqiao New Town of Yuhuatai District, Nanjing with a planned site \par area of 105,021 sq.m. and a total GFA of 343,472 sq.m. Property types will include mid- to high-end \par residential units and commercial properties; and Wuxi R&F No. 10 is located in the core area of \par Taihu New Town in Binhu District, Wuxi with an overall planned site area of 111,261 sq.m. and a \par total GFA of 233,648 sq.m. The project is planned for the construction of high-end residential \par buildings with high-quality decoration. \par  \par  \par  \par  \par                                                  - 25 - \par  \par Hainan \par  \par In 2015, the Group provided 4 projects for sale in Hainan, including R&F Bay Shore, R&F Yingxi \par Valley, R&F Mangrove Bay and R&F Moon Bay Shore. As compared with the previous year, the \par contracted sales for the year of the four projects contributed RMB1.55 billion to the Group. \par  \par Overseas \par  \par For overseas markets, R&F Princess Cove located in Johor Bahru, Malaysia has drawn much \par attention from all sectors since its launch in mid-2014. In 2015, R&F Princess Cove won the People \par Choice award 2015 for "Best Waterfront Development in Malaysia" presented by \f28 \uc2 \f2 iProperty.com\f28 \uc2 \f2 , the \par most influential professional online property portal website in Malaysia and Singapore. The award \par was voted by over 3,000 local residents and the nominees for the award included Country Garden \par Danga Bay and Greenland Jade Palace, showing a relatively high reputation of R&F Princess Cove \par in Malaysia. \par  \par The Group will launch Brisbane One for sale in Australia in 2016. The project is well-equipped with \par full facilities, including swimming pool, sky garden, indoor club and fitness center on the top level. \par For the apartment design, Brisbane One Project provides dual key apartments which could principally \par address market demand in Australia as well as demand from Chinese investors. Dual key apartments \par are commonly found in Singapore and believed to be well received by both users and investors. \par  \par  \par  \par  \par                                                 - 26 - \par  \par  \par  \par  \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 10 Mar 2016 23:18 ET \par HK Bourse: Results Announcement From \f28 \uc2 \f2 Guangzhou R&F Properties Co. Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . -14-\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par Land bank \par  \par In 2015, the Group continued to apply the same conservative and balanced criteria as always to \par general direction towards its land acquisitions. The general principles on land assessment of the \par Group during the year were total price being reasonable, fulfillment of profit forecast and quickness \par of turnover. The Group acquired 13 plots of land in 10 cities and regions with additional saleable \par area of approximately 3,605,000 sq.m. in 2015, 9 out of the 13 plots of land are located in the cities \par and regions where the Group currently has \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and 4 out the 13 plots of land are located in \par Shijiazhuang and Zhengzhou where we have newly established business presence. The Group's total \par land bank at year-end was GFA of 41.85 million sq.m. distributed across 26 cities and regions in \par China and 3 overseas cities. D